Presentations
=============

Conference and meetup slide decks powered by the JRebirth presentation module. Prefer the **ZIP** (bundled runtime): unzip, then double-click `AppName.exe`.

Desktop applications and showcase modules are on the [Apps](../apps/index.html) page.

